1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,150
Do you ever struggle with choosing your outfit in the morning?
你早上是否总为挑选穿搭而发愁？

2
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:13,640
If you have a full wardrobe yet still feel you don't have anything to wear, you might want to build yourself a capsule wardrobe!
要是你的衣柜明明满满当当，却依然觉得没衣服可穿，那或许你该给自己打造一个胶囊衣橱了！

3
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,260
So, what is this?
那么，什么是胶囊衣橱呢？

4
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:25,910
Put simply, a capsule wardrobe is a small selection of items of clothing that complement each other, and are therefore interchangeable.
简单来说，胶囊衣橱就是一小部分相互搭配、可以灵活组合的衣物。

5
00:00:25,910 --> 00:00:36,360
Key to the capsule wardrobe is solid basics, like plain tops, and, ideally, neutral colours, because they make combinations easier.
胶囊衣橱的核心是基础款单品，比如纯色上衣，而且最好是中性色系，因为这类颜色更容易搭配。

6
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:51,340
Think about the versatility of a simple pair of denim jeans. They can be combined with trainers and a t-shirt for a casual look or a blazer paired with heels, or loafers, if you want to look more sophisticated.
想想一条简约牛仔裤的百搭性：搭配运动鞋和T恤，就是一身休闲装扮；要是想穿得更精致些，配上西装外套和高跟鞋或乐福鞋就好。

7
00:00:51,340 --> 00:01:02,110
Fashion bloggers also talk about timeless classics – picture a luxury black handbag that will suit any occasion and won't go out of style.
时尚博主们还会提到永不过时的经典款——比如一只质感高级的黑色手提包，它适配各种场合，而且永远不会过时。

8
00:01:02,110 --> 00:01:06,440
But why might it be beneficial to build a capsule wardrobe?
不过，打造胶囊衣橱到底有什么好处呢？

9
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:18,560
Well, by limiting your choices, it can become much easier to choose what to wear, but there is another advantage too – it can reduce the amount of fast fashion.
首先，精简衣物选择后，早上挑衣服会变得轻松很多；其次，它还能减少快时尚的消费。

10
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:26,680
Fast fashion refers to clothes which are trendy for just a short time, so are quickly replaced by newer trends.
快时尚指的是那些只流行很短时间、很快就会被新潮流取代的服装。

11
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:36,590
This results in cheap and poor-quality clothing which has huge environmental costs as waste goes to landfill, resulting in an increase in pollution.
这类价格低廉、质量较差的衣物被当做垃圾送往填埋场，会造成严重的环境污染。

12
00:01:36,590 --> 00:01:46,550
According to UK clothes waste charity TRAID, the average garment is worn just 10 times before being disposed of.
英国衣物回收慈善机构TRAID的数据显示，一件衣服平均只被穿10次就会被丢弃。

13
00:01:46,550 --> 00:01:57,830
So, having a capsule wardrobe with long-lasting and high-quality clothes should help reduce this, even if it means paying more in the first place.
因此，拥有一个由耐穿、高品质衣物组成的胶囊衣橱，即便初期投入更高，也有助于减少这种浪费现象。

14
00:01:57,830 --> 00:02:06,310
Fashion and lifestyle magazine, Vogue, says 'building an excellent capsule wardrobe takes time and patience'.
时尚生活杂志《VOGUE》称“打造一个优质的胶囊衣橱需要时间和耐心”。

15
00:02:06,310 --> 00:02:14,430
But, if you want to reduce waste and have some extra time in the morning, it might be time to start building!
但如果你既想减少衣物浪费，又想在早上多睡几分钟，那现在或许就是开启胶囊衣橱计划的好时机！
